WEBVTT

00:00:00.635 --> 00:00:01.381
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.605 --> 00:00:05.052
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> What time do you usually get up?

00:00:09.148 --> 00:00:09.828
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:11.069 --> 00:00:13.083
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Do you usually feel tired?

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:17.823
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:19.022 --> 00:00:21.925
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Do you have a shower or a bath in the morning?

00:00:25.912 --> 00:00:26.625
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:27.656 --> 00:00:30.715
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Do you always have breakfast? Where?

00:00:34.692 --> 00:00:35.496
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:36.523 --> 00:00:38.166
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> What do you have for breakfast?

00:00:42.223 --> 00:00:42.996
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:46.244
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> What time do you go to work?

00:00:50.414 --> 00:00:51.141
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:52.444 --> 00:00:54.892
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Do you usually need to hurry in the morning?

00:00:59.045 --> 00:00:59.633
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:03.710
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Do you like mornings? Why?